# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: SailorArc | Scene: TheOldRoad4

translate zh strings:

    old "A heavy pause."
    new "沉重的停顿。"

    old "A nature like this could never have existed in her home country, she realized. Simply because the ever growing masses of people would seize on it eventually."
    new "这样的天性在她故乡绝不可能存在，她意识到这一点。毕竟，日益膨胀的民众迟早会将其据为己有。"

    old "Give yourself over to the soldiers"
    new "把自己交给士兵们"

    old "A crack rang out across the tent."
    new "一声裂响在帐篷内炸开。"

    old "A group of five or so soldiers walked into the tent, already undressed."
    new "五名士兵走进帐篷，早已脱得精光。"

    old "Ask Sigmund to protect you"
    new "请西格蒙德保护你"
